# Diwali decorations (layout-safe)

Diyas sit on **top border corners** of:

**Update boxes**
- `FfPatchStrip` (OB update strip — home / Max / lite pages via games layout)
- `FfNextUpdateCard` (next-update teaser card)

**Calculators**
- `FfCalculator` (Free Fire / Max form card)
- `SensCalculator` (BGMI / PUBG calc-card)
- `LiteSensCalculator` (BGMI Air / PUBG Flash calc-card)
- `Gta6Calculator` (GTA 6 form shell)

Shared UI: `DiwaliCardDiyas` + `SHOW_DIWALI_DIYAS` in `src/lib/diwaliDecor.ts`.

## After Diwali — same website layout

1. Set `SHOW_DIWALI_DIYAS = false` in `src/lib/diwaliDecor.ts`.
2. That turns off **all** diyas and drops `--diwali` extra top margin everywhere.
3. Do **not** bake Diwali-only spacing into default card/strip rules.
4. Optional cleanup: delete `DiwaliDiya.tsx`, `DiwaliCardDiyas.tsx`, `diwaliDiya.css`, `diwaliDecor.ts`, and `--diwali` CSS.

## Never

- Put diyas on only one calculator/update box while leaving others bare (unless user asks).
- Leave permanent margin after turning the flag off.
